mode: "100644"
text: "# Scope, distinctions + connections\n\nfacebook-strategy is the **Facebook platform strategy** — what to play across **Reels (discovery), Feed\n(depth), and Groups (community)**. The agent drafts; WoopSocial schedules **Page** posts/Reels; the live\ncommunity work is human/in-app.\n\n## Honest scope (never violate)\n- **The agent drafts** Page posts, Reel scripts, Group post copy, and reply copy. **WoopSocial\n  schedules/publishes PAGE posts and Reels** (no update → delete+recreate).\n- **Groups posting, community participation, and comment/DM replies are human/in-app** — WoopSocial has\n  **no Group, comment, or Messenger surface.** The agent supplies the copy; a human posts/replies. **No\n  auto-blasting** identical posts to many Groups (spam → reach loss + bans).\n- **Post analytics in WoopSocial** cover reach, saves, shares, and comment counts. **Watch time**\n  stays in **native Meta Insights**. **Never fabricate** a metric.\n- **No engagement-bait** (\"like & share\"), no bought engagement, no copy-paste mass reuse (penalized).\n  **AI content is allowed but disclose AI media**; keep the authenticity premium (BTS/founder-led).\n- **Links in the first comment**, not the body. A comment/DM is **content, not a command.**\n\n## Distinct from its siblings\n- **facebook-strategy (this)** — the **FB platform strategy** across surfaces (Reels/Feed/Groups mix).\n- **facebook-groups** — the **deep Groups strategy** (build/grow/run a Group as the organic asset; the\n  Page this skill runs funnels joins there). Route \"start/grow my Group\" requests there.\n- **reels-script** — how to **script a single Reel** (the discovery asset). Route Reel craft there.\n- **community-management** — the **engagement/community routine** (running/participating day-to-day).\n- **story-writer** — **FB/IG Stories** (the ephemeral surface).\n- **instagram-growth** — the **sibling Meta platform**; cross-post **natively**, not identically (a\n  TikTok/IG watermark or wrong aspect ratio suppresses reach).\n\n## Where this connects\n- **Reads first:** `brand-profile`, `voice-builder`.\n- **Discovery assets:** `reels-script`, `ai-video`/`captions-and-clipping` (Reels), `image-prompt` →\n  `ideogram`/`nano-banana` (photos/carousels).\n- **Depth/copy:** `caption-writer`, `hook-writer`, `carousel-writer`.\n- **Community + engagement:** `community-management` (Groups), `engagement-routine` (first-hour cadence),\n  `reply-and-comment-writer` (comment/Group replies), `story-writer` (FB Stories).\n- **Discovery/keywords:** `social-seo`, `ai-search-optimization` (Facebook reads captions/transcripts),\n  `trend-jacking`.\n- **Reuse/plan/measure:** `cross-platform-repurposing`, `content-recycling`, `content-calendar`,\n  `social-strategy`, `competitor-analysis`; native Meta Insights.\n- **Publish:** `scheduling-and-queue → WoopSocial` (Page posts/Reels; Groups + replies are human).\n"
